// Runs an action the sample app registered (SampleAppActions, debug builds with the SDK built from
// source): `resetToHome` opens the start screen in a fresh task from inside the app, as a test's
// setup would. In-app SDK driver only; every other driver fails the step.
launchApp(androidAppId = "ge.devtool.samples")
tap("Profile", timeout = 15s)
waitFor("Profile settings", timeout = 10s)
appAction("resetToHome")
assertVisible("Sample Screens")
assertNotVisible("Profile settings")
